   "source": [
    "# Image Processing With NumPy"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Below are some simple image processing methods implemented using simple matrix processing methods in **NumPy**.\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook was part of a lab assignment submission for the course MTH00057 - Applied Maths and Statistics at VNUHCM - University of Science."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Contents"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "* [Introduction](#c1)\n",
    "* [Implementation](#c2)\n",
    "    * [Brightness](#c21)\n",
    "    * [Contrast](#c22)\n",
    "    * [Color filters](#c23)\n",
    "    * [Flip](#c24)\n",
